  m_text: 'AR Trail puts stories, lessons and buildings-to-be on the real street:
    a city walk, a school trail or a construction site, seen through the phone.


    Made
    by Alexander Zamov in Yambol. Questions and requests: zalex8623@gmail.com.


    Trails
    are made on the website, artrails.netlify.app.'
